<!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
<section class="ac-royal sunk section" style="padding-bottom: 80px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Retail analytics questions, answered.</h2>
    </div>
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          What is the cloud back office?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The cloud back office is Teamwork Commerce's enterprise reporting and analytics platform. It extends the same Mobile POS you already run, turning transaction and mPOS data into 150+ pre-configured reports covering sales, inventory, associate performance, fulfillment and finance, with multi-currency support across 40+ countries. Live dashboards sit on top of the same data, powered by Looker. It's included with your deployment.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Can we get reporting built for our business?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>The 150+ reports are the same library for every retailer on the platform. What gets tailored is which of them your leadership reviews and how they are configured, and that work is done with you by Teamwork during implementation rather than left for your team to assemble. On the dashboard side, Looker dashboards can be customized and set to deliver on a schedule, configured by your technical specialist.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Does running reports slow down the POS?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>No. Analytical queries run on a dedicated Google BigQuery backend that is decoupled from the operational database the stores transact against, so querying years of history has no effect on checkout speed or inventory lookups. That separation is what keeps query times fast through peak trading periods such as Black Friday and Cyber Monday.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="this.parentElement.classList.toggle('open')">
          Does the cloud back office support multi-currency and localized tax reporting?
          <span class="faq-icon"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Exchange rates are configured per market in the cloud back office, so group totals can be read in your base currency instead of being reconciled by hand. Reporting also covers the fiscal summaries each market requires for its own filing, built from the transactions the POS has already recorded.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

